statement:
A fluid of viscosity $\eta$ fills the space between two long coaxial cylinders of radii $R_1$ and $R_2$ ($R_1 < R_2$). The inner cylinder is stationary while the outer rotates at constant angular velocity $\omega_2$. In laminar flow, the shear stress is $\sigma = \eta r \frac{d\omega}{dr}$. Find:
