statement:
A tube of length $l$ and radius $R$ carries a steady laminar flow of fluid of density $\rho$ and viscosity $\eta$. The flow velocity profile is $v(r) = v_0 [1 - (r/R)^2]$. Find:
(a) the volume rate of flow $Q$;
